{'symbol': 'BKR', 'date': '2023-03-07 08:00:00', 'title': 'BAKER HUGHES AND HIF GLOBAL TO COLLABORATE ON DIRECT AIR CAPTURE TECHNOLOGY', 'text': "HOUSTON, MARCH 07, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- BAKER HUGHES (NASDAQ: BKR), AN ENERGY TECHNOLOGY COMPANY, AND HIF GLOBAL, THE WORLD'S LEADING EFUELS COMPANY, ANNOUNCED TUESDAY THEIR AGREEMENT TO COOPERATE ON THE DEVELOPMENT OF TECHNOLOGY TO CAPTURE CARBON DIOXIDE DIRECTLY FROM THE ATMOSPHERE (“CO2 DIRECT AIR CAPTURE” OR “DAC”). MORE SPECIFICALLY, HIF GLOBAL AND BAKER HUGHES INTEND TO TEST BAKER HUGHES' MOSAIC DAC TECHNOLOGY PILOT UNITS TO ACCELERATE DAC DEPLOYMENT AT COMMERCIAL SCALE."}